# onnxruntime-node (used by @huggingface/transformers for on-device speech recognition) tries to
# download optional NVIDIA CUDA add-ons on Linux x64. Vayro runs the model on the CPU — those
# binaries ship inside the package — and the CUDA download 404s for 1.21.0, failing clean Linux
# installs (e.g. Vercel). Skip it.
onnxruntime-node-install-cuda=skip
